  "summary": "The experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal setup using pca_n2000 and resnet50 encoders, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5232 and F1 of 0.5084, slightly lower than the concat fusion baseline (0.5266 accuracy, 0.5104 F1). This suggests weighted fusion may not outperform concat, but the relative effectiveness of the two fusion methods remains uncertain due to limited comparative data."
